:: win F2Boss [autosave] {"position":"600,2075","size":"100,100"}
The boss health bar got to red, you go in for your last strike and succesfully hit it.
It turns into ashes and a screen pops up
<<set $floorBossBattle to false>> <<set $blueRaid to false>> <<set $raidParty to false>>
<center><img src = "Textures/Congratulations!!!.png" width="100%"/></center>
"You have beaten the floor 2 boss
Everyone who participated in this battle will get a choice to get 1 item!
Choose wisely.
You also got 2280 XP and 3138 Coins."

You can chose:
<<link [[Light armor|F2 BOSS]]>>
  <<set $f2BossKilled to true>>
  <<MobRewards>>
  <<set $StoneCP to true>>
<</link>>
<<link [[Heavy armor|F2 BOSS]]>>
  <<set $f2BossKilled to true>>
  <<MobRewards>>
  <<set $hStoneCP to true>>
<</link>>
Or you can get:
<<link [[A heavy sword|F2 BOSS]]>>
  <<set $f2BossKilled to true>>
  <<MobRewards>>
  <<set $heavyswordStone to true>> 
<</link>>
<<link [[Fire stopper scroll|F2 BOSS]]>>
  <<set $fireStopperScroll += 1>>
  <<MobRewards>>
  <<set $f2BossKilled to true>>
<</link>>

<<set $timeTillBossDies to 0>>
<<set $DEFCrimsonSentinel += 3>>
<<set $weaponDMGCrimsonSentinel += 2>>
<<set $weaponDMGRadiantRose += 1>>
<<set $weaponDMGShadowScythe += 3>>
<<set $raidParty to false>>
<<set $raidMaxHP += 100>>
 <<set $turnChanceCur to $turnChanceMax>>
    <<set $NPCs.RadiantRose.turnChanceCur to $NPCs.RadiantRose.turnChanceMax>>
    <<set $NPCs.ShadowScythe.turnChanceCur to $NPCs.ShadowScythe.turnChanceMax>>
    <<set $NPCs.CrimsonSentinel.turnChanceCur to $NPCs.CrimsonSentinel.turnChanceMax>>
    <<set $NPCs.Zegrath.turnChanceCur to $NPCs.Zegrath.turnChanceMax>>
    <<unset $bonusTurnPlayer>>
    <<unset $bonusTurnRadiantRose>>
    <<unset $bonusTurnShadowScythe>>
    <<unset $bonusTurnCrimsonSentinel>>
    <<unset $bonusTurnZegrath>>
    <<set $combat_drops = []>>
    <<set $combatCol to 0>>
    <<set $combatXP to 0>>
    <<set $combat_log = []>>


